\lang hebrew
:
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
w^{t}\gets w^{t-1}-\eta\cdot\frac{1}{n}\sum^{n}_{i=1}\left(y_{i}-\hat{y}_{w}\left(x_{i}\right)\right)\left(-x_{i}\right)
\]

